# Advanced Chalkboard

This presentation uses **custom chalkboard settings**:

- **Theme:** Whiteboard (instead of chalkboard)
- **Boardmarker Width:** 5px (thicker than default 3px)
- **Chalk Width:** 10px (thicker than default 7px)
- **Buttons:** Enabled at bottom of slides
- **Transition:** 500ms (faster than default 800ms)

===

## Whiteboard Theme

The whiteboard theme gives you:

- White background for the board
- Marker-style drawing instead of chalk
- Better for professional presentations
- Cleaner look for diagrams

===

## Thicker Lines

With increased line widths:

- **Boardmarker:** 5px (default is 3px)
- **Chalk:** 10px (default is 7px)

This makes drawings more visible in large rooms!

===

